    "notes": [
      "Mode-dependent validation also occurs in generation.py; service validates assets and account access.",
      "No default is inserted by this adapter. Native audio is preserved.",
      "Idempotency-Key is documented for this endpoint for 24 hours; no automatic retry is performed.",
      "2k bills at 3x the 768p rate and renders 16:9 (2688x1536) or 9:16 (1536x2688); text_to_video and reference_to_video need one of those aspect ratios set explicitly, because adaptive resolves at 480p and 768p only. image_to_video follows the first frame."
    ]
